{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "project-authoring",
  "name": "项目编辑与发布",
  "goal": "维护页面与系统资产，完成发布确认。",
  "theme_version": "2.0.0",
  "brief_path": "flows/project-authoring/BRIEF.md",
  "entry_page": "editor",
  "consistency_notes": [
    "编辑器、组件库和发布弹层共享同一主操作样式。",
